</section>

<section class="cf-panel" id="cf-picks"><div id="cf-opicks"></div></section>
<section class="cf-panel" id="cf-val"><div id="cf-oval"></div></section>
<section class="cf-panel" id="cf-about">
<div class="cf-card"><dl>
<dt>① 個股籌碼多圖（四組）</dt>
<dd><b>外資法人</b>：外資＋投信買賣超 60 日累計 ÷ 資本額（倍）；60 日累計買超金額與排名；扣掉大戶之 20 日周轉率 ＝ 20 日成交金額 ÷（市值 ×（1 − 大戶比例））；有 15 級資料後另有「÷ 大戶人數」與其排名。<br>
<b>大戶籌碼</b>：大戶 ＝ 持股市值 ≥ 5,000 萬元。每天用當天收盤價把 5,000 萬換算成張數，對應到最接近的集保級距（取對數距離），加總那一級以上的持股（與人數）。<br>
<b>成交量能</b>：20 日成交金額佔全市場比重（%）；20 日成交金額 ÷ 資本額（倍）。<br>
<b>貪婪恐懼</b>：把每根 K 線拆成往上（買盤）與往下（賣盤）的路徑，買盤比例的 20／60 日<b>加總</b>是貪婪指標、賣盤比例的加總是恐懼指標（兩者相加 ＝ 天數）。</dd>
<dt>② 大戶籌碼看板</dt><dd>每日：收盤、大戶比例、大戶人數、總股東人數。每週（集保）：總集保張數，以及「N 張以上」的累計持股張數與人數。</dd>
<dt>③ 個股基本面</dt><dd>近五年單季 EPS、近四季 EPS 與年增、營業利益與年增、營益率、（保留盈餘＋資本公積）÷ 股本、四季 ROA；近兩年月營收、單月／3 月／12 月累計年增、月營收公告日（次月 10 日）的收盤價、營收變動說明。</dd>
<dt>④⑤⑥ 篩選器</dt><dd>籌碼條件、基本面條件、兩者交集。排名一律「第 1 名最大」。</dd>
<dt>⑦⑧ 排名軌跡、⑨⑩ 排名榜、⑪⑫ 金額軌跡</dt><dd>法人 60 日累計買超與 20 日成交資金，在全市場的排名（或金額）怎麼一天一天移動。排名會隨市場溫度自動校準——大盤跌時某一檔的法人排名一路往前，才是資金真正的選擇。</dd>
<dt>精選漏斗</dt><dd>L0 流動性（股價 &gt; 10、20 日均額 &gt; 5,000 萬、不在 AI 選股的 E 財報否決名單）→ L1 籌碼共振（七個特徵的加權百分位前 10%，且法人、大戶、股東三根柱子至少兩根同向）→ 精選再要求共振前 5%、兩面以上成長旗標、趨勢成立（收盤 &gt; 60 日線且 20 日線 &gt; 60 日線）。權重每週用過去已實現的 20 日報酬學（rank IC，負的歸零），不是人工拍板。</dd>
<dt>已知限制</dt><dd>
・大戶人數需要集保原始 15 級（含人數），2026-09 起才開始每週累積；在那之前只有八級持股比例（級距較粗，例如股價 2,450 元時 5,000 萬 ≈ 20 張，八級只能對到 10 張那一條）。<br>
・交易所只給法人買賣超<b>股數</b>與成交<b>股數</b>，金額以 股數 × 收盤價 估算。法人的「預估成交額」「市值周轉率」需要買進、賣出分開的資料，這一版沒有。<br>
・內外盤（逐筆主動買賣）開放資料沒有，以 K 線買賣盤比例代替。<br>
・資本額用最新一期，增減資過的公司歷史比值有偏差。<br>
・「指標驗證」的回測只涵蓋籌碼（L1）與趨勢（T1），不含財報與否決名單（它們沒有逐日的歷史版本，硬算會偷看答案）。</dd>
<dt>免責</dt><dd>本頁僅為公開財務及籌碼數據之整理與自訂條件篩選輔助，不構成任何投資建議、推介、要約或招攬。各項排名與清單是過去交易資料的統計，不代表未來走勢；清單由數字自動產生，不代表推薦。</dd>
</dl></div>
</section>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
"use strict";
var BASE = "chipflow/";
var R = null, M = null, RK = null, V = null, ROWS = {}, BYNAME = {};
var cache = {};
var COLORS = ["#e4572e","#2563c9","#17a398","#a86a00","#8b3fd4","#c02a4e","#5a8f00","#0e7c6f"];

function $(id){ return document.getElementById(id); }
function el(tag, attrs){
  var n = document.createElement(tag);
  if (attrs) for (var k in attrs){
    if (k === "text") n.textContent = attrs[k];
    else if (k === "cls") n.className = attrs[k];
    else if (k === "html") n.innerHTML = attrs[k];
    else n.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]);
  }
  for (var i = 2; i < arguments.length; i++){
    var c = arguments[i];
    if (c == null) continue;
    n.appendChild(typeof c === "string" ? document.createTextNode(c) : c);
  }
  return n;
}
function svgel(tag, attrs){
  var n = document.createElementNS("http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", tag);
  for (var k in attrs) n.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]);
  return n;
}
function isnum(v){ return typeof v === "number" && isFinite(v); }
function fmt(v, d){
  if (!isnum(v)) return "—";
  return v.toLocaleString("zh-TW", {minimumFractionDigits: d||0, maximumFractionDigits: d||0});
}
function getJSON(name){
  if (cache[name]) return cache[name];
  cache[name] = fetch(BASE + name, {cache: "no-cache"}).then(function(r){
    if (!r.ok) throw new Error(name + " " + r.status);
    return r.json();
  });
  return cache[name];
}
function resolve(q){
  q = (q || "").trim();
  if (!q) return null;
  var m = q.match(/^\d{4}/);
  if (m && ROWS[m[0]]) return m[0];
  if (BYNAME[q]) return BYNAME[q];
  for (var c in ROWS){ if ((ROWS[c].n || "").indexOf(q) >= 0) return c; }
  return m ? m[0] : null;
}
function stock(code){ return getJSON("stock/" + code + ".json"); }
function label(code){ var r = ROWS[code]; return code + " " + (r ? r.n : ""); }

// ── 圖 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function chart(title, dates, series, opt){
  opt = opt || {};
  var W = opt.wide ? 1000 : 400, H = opt.wide ? 220 : 150, L = 46, Rr = 8, T = 8, B = 18;
  var card = el("div", {cls: "cf-card"});
  var tip = el("span", {cls: "cf-tip"});
  card.appendChild(el("h4", null, el("span", {text: title}), tip));
  var vals = [];
  series.forEach(function(s){ s.v.forEach(function(v){ if (isnum(v)) vals.push(v); }); });
  if (!vals.length){ card.appendChild(el("p", {cls: "cf-note", text: opt.empty || "沒有資料"})); return card; }
  var lo = Math.min.apply(null, vals), hi = Math.max.apply(null, vals);
  if (opt.bar || opt.zero){ lo = Math.min(lo, 0); hi = Math.max(hi, 0); }
  if (hi === lo){ hi = hi + 1; lo = lo - 1; }
  var pad = (hi - lo) * 0.06; hi += pad; if (!(opt.bar && lo === 0)) lo -= pad;
  var n = dates.length;
  function X(i){ return L + (n <= 1 ? 0 : i * (W - L - Rr) / (n - 1)); }
  function Y(v){ return T + (hi - v) * (H - T - B) / (hi - lo); }
  var svg = svgel("svg", {viewBox: "0 0 " + W + " " + H});
  [lo, (lo + hi) / 2, hi].forEach(function(v){
    svg.appendChild(svgel("line", {x1: L, x2: W - Rr, y1: Y(v), y2: Y(v), stroke: "var(--rule)", "stroke-width": 1}));
    var t = svgel("text", {x: L - 4, y: Y(v) + 3, "text-anchor": "end"});
    t.textContent = fmt(v, opt.d != null ? opt.d : (Math.abs(hi) < 10 ? 2 : 0)); svg.appendChild(t);
  });
  if (lo < 0 && hi > 0) svg.appendChild(svgel("line", {x1: L, x2: W - Rr, y1: Y(0), y2: Y(0), stroke: "var(--muted)", "stroke-dasharray": "3 3"}));
  var t1 = svgel("text", {x: L, y: H - 5}); t1.textContent = dates[0] || ""; svg.appendChild(t1);
  var t2 = svgel("text", {x: W - Rr, y: H - 5, "text-anchor": "end"}); t2.textContent = dates[n - 1] || ""; svg.appendChild(t2);
  series.forEach(function(s){
    var col = s.c || "var(--accent)";
    if (opt.bar){
      var bw = Math.max(1, (W - L - Rr) / n * 0.8);
      s.v.forEach(function(v, i){
        if (!isnum(v)) return;
        var y0 = Y(Math.max(0, lo)), y1 = Y(v);
        svg.appendChild(svgel("rect", {x: X(i) - bw / 2, y: Math.min(y0, y1), width: bw, height: Math.max(1, Math.abs(y1 - y0)),
          fill: opt.sign ? (v >= 0 ? "var(--up)" : "var(--down)") : col, opacity: .85}));
      });
    } else {
      var d = "", pen = false;
      s.v.forEach(function(v, i){
        if (!isnum(v)){ pen = false; return; }
        d += (pen ? "L" : "M") + X(i).toFixed(1) + " " + Y(v).toFixed(1); pen = true;
      });
      svg.appendChild(svgel("path", {d: d, fill: "none", stroke: col, "stroke-width": opt.thin ? 1.2 : 1.8}));
    }
  });
  var cur = svgel("line", {x1: 0, x2: 0, y1: T, y2: H - B, stroke: "var(--muted)", opacity: 0});
  svg.appendChild(cur);
  var ov = svgel("rect", {x: L, y: 0, width: W - L - Rr, height: H, fill: "transparent"});
  svg.appendChild(ov);
  function show(ev){
    var pt = svg.createSVGPoint(); pt.x = ev.clientX; pt.y = ev.clientY;
    var m = svg.getScreenCTM(); if (!m) return;
    var p = pt.matrixTransform(m.inverse());
    var i = Math.round((p.x - L) / (W - L - Rr) * (n - 1));
    i = Math.max(0, Math.min(n - 1, i));
    cur.setAttribute("x1", X(i)); cur.setAttribute("x2", X(i)); cur.setAttribute("opacity", .6);
    tip.textContent = dates[i] + "　" + series.map(function(s){ return (s.n ? s.n + " " : "") + fmt(s.v[i], opt.d != null ? opt.d : 2); }).join("／");
  }
  ov.addEventListener("pointermove", show);
  ov.addEventListener("pointerdown", show);
  ov.addEventListener("pointerleave", function(){ cur.setAttribute("opacity", 0); lastTip(); });
  function lastTip(){
    var i = n - 1; while (i > 0 && series.every(function(s){ return !isnum(s.v[i]); })) i--;
    tip.textContent = "最新 " + series.map(function(s){ return (s.n ? s.n + " " : "") + fmt(s.v[i], opt.d != null ? opt.d : 2); }).join("／");
  }
  lastTip();
  card.appendChild(svg);
  if (opt.note) card.appendChild(el("p", {cls: "cf-note", text: opt.note}));
  return card;
}
function group(parent, title){ parent.appendChild(el("div", {cls: "cf-grp", text: title})); var g = el("div", {cls: "cf-grid"}); parent.appendChild(g); return g; }
function sub(arr, f){ return (arr || []).map(f); }

// ── 軌跡散佈圖（⑦⑧⑪⑫）──────────────────────────────────────────────
function trail(host, items, opt){
  host.innerHTML = "";
  if (!items.length){ host.appendChild(el("p", {cls: "cf-note", text: "請先選擇個股。"})); return; }
  var W = 620, H = 440, L = 56, Rr = 16, T = 14, B = 34;
  var n = items[0].dates.length;
  var slider = el("input", {type: "range", min: 0, max: n - 1, value: n - 1, style: "flex:1;min-width:160px"});
  var play = el("button", {cls: "cf-btn", text: "▶ 播放"});
  var speed = el("select", null, el("option", {value: 400, text: "慢"}), el("option", {value: 150, text: "中"}), el("option", {value: 50, text: "快"}));
  speed.value = 150;
  var dayl = el("span", {cls: "cf-note"});
  host.appendChild(el("div", {cls: "cf-row"}, play, slider, speed, dayl));
  var card = el("div", {cls: "cf-card cf-trail"}); host.appendChild(card);
  var svg = svgel("svg", {viewBox: "0 0 " + W + " " + H}); card.appendChild(svg);
  var tx = opt.tx, ty = opt.ty;
  var xs = [], ys = [];
  items.forEach(function(it){ it.xs.forEach(function(v){ if (isnum(v)) xs.push(tx(v)); }); it.ys.forEach(function(v){ if (isnum(v)) ys.push(ty(v)); }); });
  if (opt.hline != null && isnum(opt.hline)) ys.push(ty(opt.hline));
  if (opt.xzero){ xs.push(tx(0)); }
  if (!xs.length || !ys.length){ card.appendChild(el("p", {cls: "cf-note", text: "這幾檔在期間內沒有可畫的點。"})); return; }
  var x0 = Math.min.apply(null, xs), x1 = Math.max.apply(null, xs), y0 = Math.min.apply(null, ys), y1 = Math.max.apply(null, ys);
  if (x1 === x0){ x1 += 1; x0 -= 1; } if (y1 === y0){ y1 += 1; y0 -= 1; }
  var px = (x1 - x0) * .06, py = (y1 - y0) * .06; x0 -= px; x1 += px; y0 -= py; y1 += py;
  function X(v){ var t = tx(v); return opt.xrev ? L + (x1 - t) * (W - L - Rr) / (x1 - x0) : L + (t - x0) * (W - L - Rr) / (x1 - x0); }
  function Y(v){ var t = ty(v); return opt.yrev ? T + (t - y0) * (H - T - B) / (y1 - y0) : T + (y1 - t) * (H - T - B) / (y1 - y0); }
  function draw(k){
    while (svg.firstChild) svg.removeChild(svg.firstChild);
    svg.appendChild(svgel("rect", {x: L, y: T, width: W - L - Rr, height: H - T - B, fill: "none", stroke: "var(--rule)"}));
    var ax = svgel("text", {x: (L + W - Rr) / 2, y: H - 6, "text-anchor": "middle"}); ax.textContent = opt.xlab; svg.appendChild(ax);
    var ay = svgel("text", {x: 12, y: (T + H - B) / 2, transform: "rotate(-90 12 " + (T + H - B) / 2 + ")", "text-anchor": "middle"}); ay.textContent = opt.ylab; svg.appendChild(ay);
    (opt.xticks || []).forEach(function(v){ var x = X(v); if (x < L || x > W - Rr) return; svg.appendChild(svgel("line", {x1: x, x2: x, y1: T, y2: H - B, stroke: "var(--rule)", "stroke-dasharray": v === 0 ? "4 3" : "1 3"})); var t = svgel("text", {x: x, y: H - B + 12, "text-anchor": "middle"}); t.textContent = fmt(v, opt.xd || 0); svg.appendChild(t); });
    (opt.yticks || []).forEach(function(v){ var y = Y(v); if (y < T || y > H - B) return; svg.appendChild(svgel("line", {x1: L, x2: W - Rr, y1: y, y2: y, stroke: "var(--rule)", "stroke-dasharray": "1 3"})); var t = svgel("text", {x: L - 4, y: y + 3, "text-anchor": "end"}); t.textContent = fmt(v, opt.yd || 0); svg.appendChild(t); });
    if (opt.hline != null && isnum(opt.hline)){ var hy = Y(opt.hline); svg.appendChild(svgel("line", {x1: L, x2: W - Rr, y1: hy, y2: hy, stroke: "var(--muted)", "stroke-dasharray": "5 4"})); }
    items.forEach(function(it, si){
      var col = it.color || COLORS[si % COLORS.length];
      var pts = [];
      for (var i = 0; i <= k; i++){ if (isnum(it.xs[i]) && isnum(it.ys[i])) pts.push([X(it.xs[i]), Y(it.ys[i]), i]); }
      if (!pts.length) return;
      svg.appendChild(svgel("path", {d: pts.map(function(p, j){ return (j ? "L" : "M") + p[0].toFixed(1) + " " + p[1].toFixed(1); }).join(""), fill: "none", stroke: col, "stroke-width": 1, opacity: .45}));
      pts.forEach(function(p){ svg.appendChild(svgel("circle", {cx: p[0], cy: p[1], r: 3.2, fill: col, opacity: (0.15 + 0.85 * (p[2] + 1) / (k + 1)).toFixed(2)})); });
      var last = pts[pts.length - 1];
      var lb = svgel("text", {x: last[0] + 6, y: last[1] - 6, style: "fill:" + col + ";font-size:12px;font-weight:600"}); lb.textContent = it.name; svg.appendChild(lb);
    });
    var d = items[0].dates[k] || "";
    dayl.textContent = d + "　" + items.map(function(it){ return it.name + "：" + opt.fmtx(it.xs[k]) + "／" + opt.fmty(it.ys[k]); }).join("　");
  }
  var timer = null;
  function stop(){ if (timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; play.textContent = "▶ 播放"; } }
  play.addEventListener("click", function(){
    if (timer){ stop(); return; }
    var k = +slider.value >= n - 1 ? 0 : +slider.value;
    play.textContent = "❚❚ 暫停";
    timer = setInterval(function(){ slider.value = k; draw(k); k++; if (k >= n) stop(); }, +speed.value);
  });
  slider.addEventListener("input", function(){ stop(); draw(+slider.value); });
  draw(n - 1);
  if (opt.autoplay) play.click();
}
function logTicks(lo, hi){ var out = []; [1,2,3,5,10,20,30,50,100,200,300,500,1000,2000].forEach(function(v){ if (v >= lo && v <= hi) out.push(v); }); return out; }
function symlog(v){ return v >= 0 ? Math.log10(1 + v) : -Math.log10(1 - v); }

function rankTrail(host, codes, scale){
  Promise.all([getJSON("market.json")].concat(codes.map(stock))).then(function(res){
    var mk = res[0], docs = res.slice(1);
    var n = 60, ds = mk.dates.slice(-n);
    var items = docs.filter(function(d){ return d.d; }).map(function(d, i){
      return {name: d.n, dates: ds, xs: (d.d.yr || []).slice(-n), ys: (d.d.vr || []).slice(-n), color: COLORS[codes.indexOf(d.c) % COLORS.length]};
    });
    var lg = scale === "log";
    var f = function(v){ return lg ? Math.log10(Math.max(1, v)) : v; };
    trail(host, items, {tx: f, ty: f, yrev: true, xlab: "法人 60 日買超排名（左＝第 1 名）", ylab: "成交資金佔比排名（上＝第 1 名）",
      xticks: lg ? logTicks(1, 2000) : [1, 250, 500, 1000, 1500, 2000], yticks: lg ? logTicks(1, 2000) : [1, 250, 500, 1000, 1500, 2000],
      fmtx: function(v){ return isnum(v) ? "法人第 " + v + " 名" : "—"; }, fmty: function(v){ return isnum(v) ? "資金第 " + v + " 名" : "—"; }});
    if (docs.some(function(d){ return !d.d; })) host.appendChild(el("p", {cls: "cf-note", text: "有的個股流動性不足（20 日均額 ≤ 5,000 萬），沒有產生每日序列。"}));
  }).catch(function(e){ host.textContent = "讀不到資料：" + e.message; });
}
function amountTrail(host, codes, scale, autoplay){
  Promise.all([getJSON("market.json")].concat(codes.map(stock))).then(function(res){
    var mk = res[0], docs = res.slice(1);
    var n = 60, ds = mk.dates.slice(-n);
    var items = docs.filter(function(d){ return d.d; }).map(function(d){
      return {name: d.n, dates: ds, xs: (d.d.fa || []).slice(-n), ys: (d.d.va || []).slice(-n), color: COLORS[codes.indexOf(d.c) % COLORS.length]};
    });
    var lg = scale === "log";
